f=&quot;http://www.lispworks.com/reference/HyperSpec/Body/f_funcal.htm&quot; class=&quot;symbol&quot;&gt;funcall&lt;/a&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;paren3&quot;&gt;(&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.lispworks.com/reference/HyperSpec/Body/f_funcal.htm&quot; class=&quot;symbol&quot;&gt;funcall&lt;/a&gt; x x&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; y&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;paren5&quot;&gt;(&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.lispworks.com/reference/HyperSpec/Body/a_lambda.htm&quot; class=&quot;symbol&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;symbol&quot;&gt;lambda&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;paren6&quot;&gt;(&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;paren6&quot;&gt;(&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.lispworks.com/reference/HyperSpec/Body/f_funcal.htm&quot; class=&quot;symbol&quot;&gt;funcall&lt;/a&gt; f &lt;span class=&quot;paren1&quot;&gt;(&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.lispworks.com/reference/HyperSpec/Body/a_lambda.htm&quot; class=&quot;symbol&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;symbol&quot;&gt;lambda&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;paren2&quot;&gt;(&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;y&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;paren2&quot;&gt;(&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.lispworks.com/reference/HyperSpec/Body/f_funcal.htm&quot; class=&quot;symbol&quot;&gt;funcall&lt;/a&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;paren3&quot;&gt;(&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.lispworks.com/reference/HyperSpec/Body/f_funcal.htm&quot; class=&quot;symbol&quot;&gt;funcall&lt;/a&gt; x x&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; y&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;paren3&quot;&gt;(&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.lispworks.com/reference/HyperSpec/Body/a_lambda.htm&quot; class=&quot;symbol&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;symbol&quot;&gt;lambda&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;paren4&quot;&gt;(&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;f&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;paren4&quot;&gt;(&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.lispworks.com/reference/HyperSpec/Body/a_lambda.htm&quot; class=&quot;symbol&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;symbol&quot;&gt;lambda&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;paren5&quot;&gt;(&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;paren5&quot;&gt;(&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.lispworks.com/reference/HyperSpec/Body/s_if.htm&quot; class=&quot;symbol&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;symbol&quot;&gt;if&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;paren6&quot;&gt;(&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.lispworks.com/reference/HyperSpec/Body/f_zerop.htm&quot; class=&quot;symbol&quot;&gt;zerop&lt;/a&gt; n&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;1&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;paren6&quot;&gt;(&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.lispworks.com/reference/HyperSpec/Body/a_st.htm&quot; class=&quot;symbol&quot;&gt;*&lt;/a&gt; n &lt;span class=&quot;paren1&quot;&gt;(&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.lispworks.com/reference/HyperSpec/Body/f_funcal.htm&quot; class=&quot;symbol&quot;&gt;funcall&lt;/a&gt; f &lt;span class=&quot;paren2&quot;&gt;(&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.lispworks.com/reference/HyperSpec/Body/f_1pl_1_.htm&quot; class=&quot;symbol&quot;&gt;1-&lt;/a&gt; n&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;5&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;comment&quot;&gt;;; ==&amp;gt; 120&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description> <pubDate>TUE, 06 Sep 2011 14:02:04 GMT</pubDate> </item>  <item> <title>andy128k: вопрос к знатокам</title> <link>http://lisper.ru/forum/messages/6225</link> <description>Да. Есть такая вещь: анафорическая лямбда.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;(defmacro alambda (params &amp;amp;body body) &lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; `(labels ((self ,params ,@body))&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; #&#039;self))</description> <pubDate>TUE, 06 Sep 2011 08:56:15 GMT</pubDate> </item>  <item> <title>archimag: вопрос к знатокам</title> <link>http://lisper.ru/forum/messages/6224</link> <description>Так безымянную или лямбду? ;) См. alexandria:named-lambda</description> <pubDate>TUE, 06 Sep 2011 08:05:17 GMT</pubDate> </item>  <item> <title>stairs: вопрос к знатокам</title> <link>http://lisper.ru/forum/messages/6223</link> <description>возможно ли в CL создать безымянную(лямбда) &lt;b&gt;рекурсивную&lt;/b&gt; функцию?&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description> <pubDate>TUE, 06 Sep 2011 07:57:49 GMT</pubDate> </item>  </channel> </rss>